qabr-e-asghar pa jo shabbir ko rona aaya<br>
us ghadi madar-e-besheer ko rona aaya<br>
<br>
1. baad mere jo layin khodeinge qabr-e-asghar<br>
sonch ke hazrat-e-shabbir ko rona aaya<br>
<br>
2. ali asghar ki shahadat jo raqam ki haq ne<br>
lohey mehfooz ki tehreer ko rona ayya<br>
<br>
3. shey no khodi jo lahad roke toh boli shamsheer<br>
mujhko mazloomiye be sheer pa rona aaya<br>
<br>
4. sab toh sab roye magar haye yeh kaisa rona<br>
sansanate huwe khud teer ko rona aaya<br>
<br>
5. khat padha shah ne sughra ka jo rote rote<br>
khat-e-sughra ki bhi tehreer ko rona aaya<br>
<br>
6. dekha sar naize pa abid ne johin asghar ka<br>
istarha roye ke zanjeer ko rona aaya<br>
<br>
7. dhondti phirti hai har simth ali asgar ko<br>
jab suna margaye humsheer ko rona aaya.<br>
<br>
8. nouha asghar ka padha roke raza ne jisdam<br>
hashmi madar-e-shabir ko rona aaya …